Deployment Verification Checklist (SRE)

After uploading the model and creating the endpoint, verify the deployment before proceeding to inference testing.

✅ Model Registration Verification
gcloud ai models list --region=us-central1

Inspect details:
gcloud ai models describe MODEL_ID --region=us-central1

✅ Endpoint Verification
gcloud ai endpoints list --region=us-central1

Inspect details:
gcloud ai endpoints describe ENDPOINT_ID --region=us-central1

✅ Model Deployment Verification

Confirm model is attached to endpoint:

gcloud ai endpoints describe ENDPOINT_ID \
  --region=us-central1

✅ Traffic Verification

Verify traffic allocation:

gcloud ai endpoints describe ENDPOINT_ID \
  --region=us-central1 \
  --format="yaml(trafficSplit)"

✅ Logging Verification
gcloud logging read \
'resource.type="aiplatform.googleapis.com/Endpoint"' \
--limit=20

✅ Container Health Verification

Common indicators of success:

 Container starts successfully
 Prediction server binds to expected port
 Health checks pass
 No crash-loop behavior
 Resource allocation sufficient

✅ Final Readiness Validation

Document:

PROJECT_ID   = <PROJECT_ID>
REGION       = us-central1

MODEL_NAME   = my-model
MODEL_ID     = <MODEL_ID>

ENDPOINT_NAME = my-endpoint
ENDPOINT_ID   = <ENDPOINT_ID>

DEPLOYMENT_STATUS = SUCCESS
TRAFFIC_SPLIT     = 100%
VERIFIED_BY       = <engineer>
VERIFIED_DATE     = <date>


